        "text_6MDhiP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Worthy Products is a New Zealand wholesale distributor supplying  confectionery, beverages, grocery, health and beauty products to  3,000+ NZ dairies, petrol stations, supermarkets, convenience stores  and school canteens. Operating from our Auckland warehouse, we stock  1,500+ products from brands including Cadbury, Whittaker's, Wrigley's,  Nestlé, Pascall, Mars, Indomie, Pringles, Bundaberg, Mogu Mogu, Dove,  Colgate, BIC and many more. Orders placed before 10am are dispatched same day, NZ-wide. We are the exclusive NZ distributor for brands like H2 Coco, Riclan, Lava Lush, Fararelle and many more.  New wholesale accounts welcome, download our application forms to get started.</p>",
